", "id": "1163447326729178", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628893_1163447330062511_8989197803431640859_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UUW8vRXRJAQQ7kNvwELzTNz&_nc_oc=AdpDiTeGU4zHEG72ppKcqgYVZXaW7CWwBL86h9hZcVjiJi6UylcLMf1Ci_hOS0cuBOM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIE1uzGTQcDfBb5z4Y6AlZfbU4LZjKHxf5DZBvjN8qKgQ&oe=6AA6998C"}, {"file_name": "axe-arcade-shot2-crack.png", "id": "28086649111029418", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622192_28086649121029417_5437282509902378159_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9NboXjCkmZ0Q7kNvwHvqpNE&_nc_oc=Ado7bI7YfajfQB5tKHAn63S60_ZS5MLVYKbDP3Q7TuFzbbCD6satAZnGZ_MJPNEAYSo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQILMm0FqTZG_2_3-ptdOpKdOp_ueKsl_Nd2iqu-jYvZSQ&oe=6AA6C829"}, {"file_name": "axe-arcade-shot3-holmganga.png", "id": "1592386091803548", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628909_1592386095136881_7491312281703280760_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8TwXH6QYrokQ7kNvwFl7zGF&_nc_oc=AdqIPN5vHP3WN9mUBYnwWXrUlOAQGcOZPEyMd6cRkn2SKouPUbshURMpmn31RRcV2mQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQInwelnG6aiTPCqmbi72xDXFkDh2Dhio6bARf-OSpBS5Q&oe=6AA69B66"}, {"file_name": "axe-arcade-shot4-fjord.png", "id": "1724378155323202", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593919959_1724378158656535_1449830462000487333_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-VT1QCFiVTQQ7kNvwGOBftv&_nc_oc=AdpzBm84R3Pj6-vF2ijVWi8KKJ42Yr3XL2T3r5ZgCjO_sWrcciWT0RhM25g__ht2lIc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLJZpovTQml3Ur1ZCn3WiYWAjMyE1BS7YrwvfuOV2mjuQ&oe=6AA6A232"}, {"file_name": "axe-arcade-shot5-valley.png", "id": "1607551704104069", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622184_1607551707437402_4148346033697722451_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Vgpfx1Hok5kQ7kNvwF7ibaQ&_nc_oc=Adr_vNXzPCu9NgOyh3GeTbszA_GEi0Ond3Vds0wknhb6ePZ_XpJpH4BZb9L0EXr-4NY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKFCUbDB2uN7OyoZFgKf6MIrDnpS2Zu3vlxAgpFwkzk7g&oe=6AA6C6AF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "AxeArcade_trailer_cover.png", "id": "1061070172992027", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1061070176325360_7984314788343204879_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=USb8tm9vIIkQ7kNvwHBFb7B&_nc_oc=AdrquUvIgnJSpyB-dLdJWtboBzrEBzGg-wTcYgxaMT4gIzDsxm_FI1-3_3HHPJsFAwc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIJEE1IfiRs_QKdI6FBCt2h0P3s4JAJGqPefiR1TefPyQ&oe=6AA69413"}, "display_name": "Axe Arcade", "keywords": ["axe", "throwing", "arcade", "bullseye", "casual"], "long_description": "**How good is your throw?**\n\nPick up an axe with a natural grip, feel its weight as you wind up, and send it spinning end-over-end into the board. Every throw is pure physics and timing \u2014 nail the bullseye for the big score and chase a higher total round after round.\n\n## What you do\n- Grab the axe anywhere on the handle \u2014 grip button, either hand.\n- Wind up and release with a real throwing motion; the axe flies the way you throw it.\n- Hit the target board \u2014 the closer to the bullseye, the bigger the score.\n- Ten throws a round. Beat your high score.\n\n## Pick your challenge\n- Four difficulty tiers: EASY, NORMAL, VIKING and BERSERKER.\n- Two venues to throw in \u2014 the Training Field and Fjord Lane.\n- Fjord Lane adds a distance ladder: land a scoring hit and the board steps farther away.\n- Leaderboards for your best rounds.\n\n## Built for comfort\n- Play seated or standing \u2014 everything is within arm's reach.\n- No artificial movement, no smooth turning, no vection. Comfortable rating.\n- Simple to learn, satisfying to master.", "short_description": "Grab an axe, wind up, and let it fly \u2014 sink bullseyes and climb the high-score board in this pick-up-and-play VR throwing game."}]}, "developer_name": "Little Forge Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://littleforge.pages.dev/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Little Forge Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://littleforge.pages.dev/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1310210368842978"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604275479_2262305381275121_2908255081075092594_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s5kQAx60Ok8Q7kNvwE17bym&_nc_oc=AdrHAyDlrIcE3Vmc0K88iS-W1_Evm-JI33_SoLjadN4VnliOB5BP0Wn_8iu2FweZxKQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ41k3EDMJA0PFLRBSmh83frVNfYx6Lkhy6LE-52N_yBw&oe=6AA6992C"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Axe Arcade", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Action", "id": "459781504968480"}, {"topic_name": "Arcade", "id": "1592192974313489"}], "release_date": 1784693940, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "1184265284770821", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp